flowchart LR
    A[Input: User Preferences\nGenre, mood, target energy,\nacoustic preference, top K] --> B[Load songs.csv]
    B --> C{For each song in CSV}

    C --> D[Compare song to user preferences]
    D --> E[Calculate weighted score\nGenre match + mood match\nEnergy and audio-feature similarity]
    E --> F[Store song, score,\nand explanation]
    F --> C

    C -->|All songs evaluated| G[Sort songs by score\nhighest to lowest]
    G --> H[Select top K recommendations]
    H --> I[Output: Ranked Recommendations\nSong details, scores, explanations]
